WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:08.008
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; Announcer: "GAME OF
THRONES," THE FINAL SEASON.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:11.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
ONLY SIX EPISODES REMAIN UNTIL
WE SAY GOODBYE TO HBO'S

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:15.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
