00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:19.652
PREQUELS, SEQUELS, AND SPINOFFS.
LIKE "CASTLE BLACK," A SEX,

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
MOODY DRAMA ABOUT FORBIDDEN
LOVE.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:23.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; HEY.
&gt;&gt; YOU CAME.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:28.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
AND YOU PROMISED THAT WHEN

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:32.265
