FRIENDS ABOUT ME, ABOUT US.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
WINTER IS HERE, JON.
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT THAT SIMPLE.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU'RE DEAD.
&gt;&gt; YOU WERE DEAD TOO.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS DIFFERENT AND YOU
KNOW IT.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
STOP.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.911
STOP THAT.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHAT YOU WANT, ISN'T

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:49.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
IT?
COME TAKE IT.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:55.722
&gt;&gt;&gt; AND CHECK OUT EVERYONE'S
FAVORITE ASSASSIN IN CARTOON

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
FORM.
IT'S ARYA.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:01:01.528
&gt;&gt; HEY, ARYA, ARE YOU GOING TO
THE DANCE WITH THE FACELESS MAN?

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:05.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; A GIRL IS GOING WITH HER
FRIENDS.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:09.202
&gt;&gt; AND IF YOU'RE LOOKING FOR
LAUGHS, YOU'LL LOVE SAM AND

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:13.173 align:start size:94% position:6%
