LANDING."

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:14.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SAM, WHAT HAPPENED TO THE
KITCHEN?

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:17.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
WERE WE ATTACKED BY THE FREE
