00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:22.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; EVEN WORSE.
I TRIED TO MAKE DINNER.

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:27.987
&gt;&gt; PLUS IT'S GOING TO BE A GAME
OF CROSSOVERS WITH SHOWS LIKE

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:34.260
