00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:39.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THIS WHITE BITCH KNOW HE
CAN'T STOP ME.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:44.404
YO, WHY Y'ALL GOT ME OUT HERE
BATTLING BOOTLEG KING JOFFREY?

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:54.681
&gt;&gt; AND OVER ON HBO KIDS, WE GOT
